%% Sequence Diagram for Youth Account Management (Mermaid)
sequenceDiagram
    participant Parent as Parent/Guardian
    participant Web as Web Frontend
    participant APIGW as API Gateway
    participant Auth as Auth Service
    participant YAS as Youth Account Service
    participant AccS as Account Service
    participant TxS as Transaction Service
    participant PayS as Payment Service

    Parent->>Web: Login & access dashboard
    Web->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/dashboard (Bearer token)
    APIGW->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 token (RBAC: parent)
    Auth-->>APIGW: Token valid
    APIGW->>YAS: getYouthAccountDashboard(youthAccountId)
    YAS->>AccS: Fetch youth account data
    YAS->>TxS: Fetch recent transactions
    YAS-->>APIGW: Dashboard data
    APIGW-->>Web: Dashboard JSON
    Web-->>Parent: Render dashboard
    Note over Parent,Web: All actions logged for audit

    Parent->>Web: Initiate fund transfer
    Web->>APIGW: POST /api/youth-accounts/{id}/fund-transfer
    APIGW->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 token
    Auth-->>APIGW: Token valid
    APIGW->>YAS: transferFundsToYouthAccount
    YAS->>PayS: Initiate fund transfer
    PayS-->>YAS: Transfer result
    YAS-->>APIGW: Fund transfer response
    APIGW-->>Web: Response
    Web-->>Parent: Show result
    Note over Parent,YAS: Fund transfer audit logged

    Parent->>Web: Update spending limit
    Web->>APIGW: PUT /api/youth-accounts/{id}/spending-limit
    APIGW->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 token
    Auth-->>APIGW: Token valid
    APIGW->>YAS: configureSpendingLimit
    YAS-->>APIGW: Updated
    APIGW-->>Web: Response
    Web-->>Parent: Show confirmation
    Note over Parent,YAS: Spending limit change audit logged

    Parent->>Web: View transactions
    Web->>APIGW: GET /api/youth-accounts/{id}/transactions?...
    APIGW->>Auth: Validate OAuth2 token
    Auth-->>APIGW: Token valid
    APIGW->>YAS: getYouthAccountTransactions
    YAS->>TxS: Fetch transactions
    YAS-->>APIGW: Transaction history
    APIGW-->>Web: Response
    Web-->>Parent: Show history
    Note over Parent,Web: Access logged for audit
